data: {"session_id":"1c047b6c-cb6b-4b06-9d0b-e14ca5330d2d","seq":32,"kind":"assistant","payload":{"attachments":["/workspace/report.pdf","/workspace/screenshot.png"],"text":"All four steps done.\n\n1. **Research**: HTTP 418 = \"I'm a teapot\" — an April Fools' joke status from RFC 2324 (Hyper Text Coffee Pot Control Protocol, 1994); RFC 9110 later reserves it. Sources: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Status/418, https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2324, https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110\n2. **Built**: /workspace/app (index.html + app.js) — HTTP status lookup covering 13 codes including 418, served on http://localhost:8000.\n3. **Tested**: typed 418, clicked Look up — page showed \"418 I'm a teapot\" with its meaning; screenshot saved.\n4. **Reported**: /workspace/report.md converted to PDF.\n\nPaths:\n- PDF: /workspace/report.pdf\n- Screenshot: /workspace/screenshot.png"},"at":1793932257155}

