data: {"session_id":"1c047b6c-cb6b-4b06-9d0b-e14ca5330d2d","seq":42,"kind":"assistant","payload":{"attachments":["/workspace/report.pdf"],"text":"Done.\n\n1. **Footer sentence added** to the test-result section: \"The page footer reads 'Built inside a gVisor box', confirming the app runs in the sealed workspace container.\"\n2. **RFC 2324 date verified** via web_fetch: it was published **1 April 1998** (not 1994 as previously stated) — corrected in the report.\n3. **PDF regenerated**: /workspace/report.pdf (57,387 bytes)."},"at":1793932282976}

